docs {
Daftar akun (admin/root). Cursor pagination. Filter q (username, email,
atau nomor HP; query angka 08.../+62.../62... dinormalisasi ke 62...),
role, can_contribute, email_verified (true/false; false = user mentok
verifikasi OTP / email gagal terkirim).

200 sukses:

    {
      "success": true,
      "data": [
        {
          "id": "01J...",
          "username": "budi",
          "display_name": "Budi Santoso",
          "email": "budi@example.com",
          "phone": "6281234567890",
          "roles": ["contributor"],
          "role": "contributor",
          "avatar_url": null,
          "auth_providers": [],
          "is_active": true,
          "can_contribute": true,
          "contribute_muted_until": null,
          "email_verified": true,
          "email_verified_at": "2026-08-01T00:05:00.000Z",
          "otp": null,
          "created_at": "2026-08-01T00:00:00.000Z",
          "updated_at": null
        }
      ],
      "meta": {
        "limit": 20,
        "next_cursor": null,
        "has_more": false
      }
    }

avatar_url null = belum ada foto. Console menampilkan avatar lingkaran,
atau ikon default bila null / gambar gagal dimuat.

email_verified false + otp null = tidak ada OTP tertunda (mis. email gagal
terkirim) - admin bisa verifikasi manual via
POST /api/v1/admin/users/:id/verify-email. otp terisi = OTP terakhir belum
dipakai / sudah kadaluarsa.
}

meta {
  name: Admin List Users
  seq: 41
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/users?limit=20
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{access_token}}
}

tests {
  test("200 + avatar_url di tiap user", () => {
    expect(res.status).to.equal(200);
    expect(res.body.success).to.equal(true);
    expect(res.body.data).to.be.an("array");
    expect(res.body.meta).to.have.property("has_more");
    for (const item of res.body.data) {
      expect(item).to.have.property("avatar_url");
      expect(item).to.have.property("display_name");
      expect(item).to.have.property("phone");
      expect(item).to.have.property("email_verified");
      expect(item.otp === null || (item.otp && item.otp.expires_at)).to.equal(true);
      expect(item).to.not.have.property("password_hash");
    }
  });
}
